WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.763
- Your costar, Mandy Moore,

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.280
she's about to have her first baby.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.520
Have you given her any parenting advice?

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:10.650
- You know, I haven't yet,
but, it's unbelievable.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.883
This woman is like, she's radiant.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.920
You would never know she was pregnant.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:20.920
I mean, she's like, she looks
like she could run a marathon.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:23.210
But I would tell her, if I did
have to tell her something,

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:25.447
I would say, "Get your
sleep now, lovely woman,"

00:00:25.447 --> 00:00:28.427
"because when the babies come,
you're not gonna sleep much."

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:29.317
"And if you do sleep,

00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:30.880
"it won't be the same quality of sleep."

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:31.940
Wouldn't you agree?

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:32.773
- Oh my God.

00:00:32.773 --> 00:00:36.510
I literally, like on
Christmas vacation, my son,

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.420
I woke up in the middle
of the night and he's four

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.100
and I woke up and I was like (breathes in)

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.030
and I couldn't breathe, and
I was like, what's happening?

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.010
And they were having a
sleepover, my two little kids,

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:47.730
and he was sleeping on my body.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.600
I was like, I mean, I already can't turn.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:52.130
I don't turn if we have sleepovers,

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.800
'cause I have to keep my wide stance,

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:55.530
so they don't take over my spot.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.930
He was full on, on top of me.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.376
And I was like, "Bro, get
off, I can't breathe!"

00:01:00.376 --> 00:01:02.120
- [Justin] Oh, they don't
care, they don't care.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.353
- It is the worst sleep.

